# CPU Utilization Monitoring using Raspberry Pi 4B

## Aim
To monitor CPU utilization of Raspberry Pi 4B using Python.

## Components Required
- Raspberry Pi 4B
- Python 3
- psutil library

## Working
The Python program uses the psutil library
to monitor CPU usage.

It displays the CPU utilization percentage
in the terminal.

## Output
Displays real-time CPU usage percentage.

## Conclusion
CPU utilization is successfully monitored
using Raspberry Pi 4B.
